dsh-alioth — vendored Alioth model artifacts
Copyright 2026 The dsh-alioth Authors

This directory redistributes artifacts of the Alioth data model (v10.x)
consumed from the published model distribution (github:CosmicTools9/AppCreator,
subsequently mirrored at github:CosmicTools9/Alioth), licensed Apache-2.0:

  backend/ddl/*isahl_meta*.sql           — isahl_meta registry baseline DDL + seed
  skill-adapters/*.yaml                  — AppAgent track/step/gate definitions (v2.0–v2.2;
                                           upstream `Meta/backend/app-agent/skill-adapters/`)
  scripts/prototype-tool.js              — prototype build chain (PROTOTYPE_TOOL_ROOT override added)
  scripts/capability-catalog.ts          — scope capability catalog (gate + CLI)
  scripts/check/audit-css-framework.mjs  — CSS framework audit
  scripts/check/check-nav-hrefs.ts       — prototype nav integrity check
  scripts/check/check-prototype-types.ts — prototype source mechanical checks
  scripts/check/check-prototype-render.ts — prototype render assertions (real browser)
  scripts/check/check-namespace-frontend.sh|.ts — module frontend build-contract check
  scripts/eval/evaluate-prototype-reference.ts — prototype evaluation
  scripts/eval/appagent-build-eval.ts, appagent-client.ts, *.selftest.ts —
                                           AppAgent build-regression eval + session client
  Meta/backend/app-agent/eval/cases.yaml — eval baseline case set (read at its upstream path)
  scripts/lib/                           — shared parser façade + gate/cargo/sql helpers
  scripts/build-ns.sh, scripts/cargo-check.sh — namespace build + isolated cargo check
  .agents/skills/alioth-design/references/ — design tokens, shells, icon pool, vendor runtime
  .agents/skills/alioth-service/references/ — service-track reference notes
  docs/specs/BLOCK_SCHEMA.md, docs/specs/MODULE_SPEC.md — adapter reference specifications
  Pre-Proc/Alioth/Prototypes/Modules/system-settings/llm-tsx/module.tsx —
                                           module assembly reference declared by alioth-module 1.3
  Pre-Proc/Alioth/Sources/Apps/Services/, Pre-Proc/Alioth/openapi/ — baseline services the
                                           vendored gateway manifest path-deps on
  Framework/frontend/components/utilities.json — utility registry

The .agents design assets and Framework utilities.json are consumed from the
AliothStudio working checkout (same authors, The Alioth Authors) to complete
the prototype chain the build scripts require; hashes are pinned in
PROVENANCE.json. Gateway runtime state (`Gateway/backend/data/`, the local
file-storage root upstream gitignores) is deliberately NOT vendored.
 
